## Why This Is Asked

This question tests ability to design a CAPA for ML drift in a real-time system with multi-region considerations, plus practical data modeling and API design.

## Key Concepts

- CAPA data model with evidence and region
- Lifecycle state machine for CAPA progression
- Minimal REST API endpoints for create/update
- Region-aware metrics and canary remediation
- RCA templating for root-cause communication

## Code Example

```javascript
// Minimal API sketch
const express = require('express');
const app = express();
app.use(express.json());

app.post('/caps', (req, res) => {
  // create CAPA with fields from req.body
  res.status(201).send({ id: 'CAPA-001' });
});
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you validate canary results before roll-out?
- What data lineage artifacts would you capture and store?

